  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avrop fr&#xe5;n ramavtal ISK granskning ODWaCE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call-off from framework agreement ISK audit ODWaCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag syftar till att utv&#xe4;rdera ODWaCEs system f&#xf6;r intern styrning och kontroll. Konsulten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter och l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer avseende f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar. Baserat p&#xe5; resultaten kan Sida komma att kr&#xe4;va att ODWaCE &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rdar vissa svagheter innan ett eventuellt avtal kan undertecknas och/eller att &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder inkluderas som avtalsvillkor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at reviewing the system for internal control ofODWaCE. The consultant is expected to identify any possible weaknesses amd make recommendations for improvement. Based on the findings, Sida may require that ODWaCE addresses identified weaknesses prior to a potential agreement and/or add some of the measures as agreement conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
